WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Eight fixed camera anchors. Three subjects. Unreal Engine 5.6.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Tracking changes yaw, pitch and lens framing at a fixed position.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Camera handoffs blend the two rendered views.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Face and torso probes check whether obstacles block the shot.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Facing direction helps rank the eligible cameras.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Lookroom shifts composition toward the subject's facing direction.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Choose Arun, Mira or Dev with the 1, 2 and 3 controls.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
The same selection and framing logic follows each subject.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.000
C++ handles the director; a Blueprint policy ranks eligible shots.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.000
The green marker identifies the active camera on the layout.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Inspect the live feed, focal length, FOV and fixed anchor position.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Camera system by Aayush. Character bases and walk: Quaternius CC0.
